<item>
<title>Yemen and the Red Sea: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/yemen/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-yemen-2026-10-24T16:46:07.227Z</guid>
<pubDate>Sat, 24 Oct 2026 16:46:07 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Houthi forces have intensified missile and drone strikes on Saudi targets, hitting Riyadh, Khamis Mushait, Dammam airport and an air base, while Saudi air defenses have shot down several missiles and drones over Saudi territory. In Yemen, Houthi attacks on Sanaa and Aden have killed civilians, and Saudi airstrikes in Houthi-controlled areas have also caused civilian deaths, including women and children. The United Nations warns that water supplies are dwindling in the besieged city of Taiz and in another Yemeni city under Houthi siege. Brent crude rose to its highest level since April after Houthi attacks disrupted oil markets. The conflict caused 918 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Hindu&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Times of Israel&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Hindu&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMixAFBVV95cUxPc19teGtnWFl2RFpiT0lpNXI1SkpUOHZsNnV1TkhlbnMzQzFhUXBzbzE2ZGozMTY2OE5MZi1WZmo2blN5YW81WVVTelBxbS13bXNzQjBubnhxWnJTeERiT0pGMG9jQnFoRkJubHUweTg2bklrSUJVMV9fYVZWTjgyNEpMWUxXVWpEdnUtcFBkVGNsR2FxX0tydFdHOEVYbFVyX3lrLVFheVEtVk1ncmlldlpHamYtc2d6SXg5MUR3Y3IwaER2?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Times of Israel&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiW0FVX3lxTE1OWDNRWTNxMkEyVlFfSEZmUVlPVlNncENwMDBNck1XNDRWZzEzVDV0VVdzQUx5UW1wZVpwSnN5ZUxlUERKb20ycjUtNExTX1pOeDZva1BiTVFxZUk?oc=5&quot;&gt;BBC&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMitgFBVV95cUxOeWJ2bGllV1N5MGZKTC1hWXRQUmV5U0xTNll5Q1hTVG1sczNVNjZwNDVuX2NmS2swOFJfOUx0bkpVSGJKWENCZ3AwS2czZ2pXZ3lUOVZXelBMaXZRaUZkX1loWjRndjQ3dXcydFRLdVc3cFQ3ZkRVS2szTTc5S0xtU01CT1hQS0lFX1IxbUNNQk81dzFCbk5wTzhwcHptX0RPejd3eENNdGRLZEM5QmtMMmlUWU9nZw?oc=5&quot;&gt;